    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0562" n="458" xml:id="pg458"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/914.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-12-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 18, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Government wishes to know whether or not this loan can be made against the
                    Public Works bonds now on deposit in the United States if, in your opinion,
                    interest will be saved thereby. The Government is in serious need of a part of
                    the loan at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
